  "releaseNotes": "# New Features\n      - Enabled dynamic CSS configuration.\n      - Added ContextMenuField.\n      - Enabled padding configuration for PageFrame.\n      - Added scroll functionality to Grid and Canvas.\n      - Changed width and height types from int? to double?.\n      # Breaking Changes\n      - Button images, which previously supported only one type, now support multiple types. (Migration via the designer is available)\n      # Bug Fixes\n      - Fixed an exception that occurred when using a module with IsFillAvailable enabled in the sidebar.",
